sequenceDiagram
  actor User
  participant Mobile
  participant API
  participant Maps as Map Provider
  User->>Mobile: Search destination
  Mobile->>API: POST /v1/places/search
  API->>Maps: Search (permitted fields)
  Maps-->>API: Candidate results + attribution
  API-->>Mobile: Validated candidates
  User->>Mobile: Confirm destination
  Mobile->>API: POST /v1/routes/walking
  API->>Maps: Walking route request
  Maps-->>API: Route geometry and steps
  API-->>Mobile: Validated route
  Mobile-->>User: Route summary and Start action
